    "chunk_text": "rymynde & cwe\u00f0ende, la Dauides sunu, So\u00f0lice \u00fea he ham com \u00fea blindan geneal\u00e6hton to him & se H\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, gelyfe gyt \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00d0a \u00e6thran he hyra eagena cwe\u00f0ynde, sy inc \u00e6ftyr incrun geleafan. And hyra eagan w\u00e6run ontynede; & se H\u00e6lynd bebead him cw\u00feende, warnia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge hyt nanum men Hig so\u00f0lice utgangynde gewidm\u00e6rsudun hyne ofer eall \u00fe\u00e6t land. \u00d0a hig w\u00e6ron so\u00f0lice ut agane hig brohton him dumbne man se w\u00e6s deofulseoc. & utadryfenum \u00feam deofle se dumba spr\u00e6c; & \u00fea menigeo wundredon cwe\u00f0ende, N\u00e6fre \u00e6tywde So\u00felice \u00fea sundorhalgan cw\u00e6don, on deofla ealdre he drif\u00f0 ut deoflu. And se H\u00e6lend ymbfor ealle burga & ceastra l\u00e6rende on hyra gesomnungum & bodiende rices He gemiltsude so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6re menigeo \u00fea he hi geseah for\u00fean hig w\u00e6run gedrehte & licgende swa swa \u00dea he s\u00e6de hys leorningcnihtun, witodlice micel rip ys & feawa wyrhtyna. Bidda\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6s ripes hlaford \u00fe\u00e6t he sende wyrhtan to his ripe. And tosomne gecigydum hys twelf leorningcnihtun he sealde him uncl\u00e6nra gasta anweald \u00fe\u00e6t hig \u00d0is synt so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6ra twelf apostola naman; Se forma ys Simon \u00fee ys genemned Petrus, & Andreas Philippus, & Bartholomeus, Thomas, & Matheus Puplicanus, & Iacobus Alphei, &",
